<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E group net rises in Q1.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E group net rises in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Export preliminary group results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		 12.64   vs    5.52</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		   18.53   vs    9.85</p>
<p>    Group net profit			 20.57   vs   11.27</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Export SA. @</p>
<p>    Group net sales			 113.59   vs   94.01</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales		  102.39   vs   81.81</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary profit	    3.08   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Group income tax			  1.57   vs    1.18</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues	     17.57   vs   12.26</p>
<p>    Group financial costs		  14.75   vs    7.94</p>
<p>    Group investment			  3.02   vs   13.37</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
